WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.334
The robot arm approaches the black book on the table from above, grasps it, lifts it, and moves it to the right to place it into the back compartment of the caddy.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
approach and grasp the book

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
lift and move the book to the caddy

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
place the book into the back compartment and release
